    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d794">

                <pb facs="1019" n="923" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg923"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to the President.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-10-07"><hi rendition="#italic">October 7,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 5.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Telegram received. In view of the answer made by us on Monday last [No. 1] with
                    your approval to Spanish proposition as to status quo in Philippines, we think
                    we are precluded from presenting to Spanish commissioners here any question
                    properly belonging to two Governments, or to the commissioners at Habana or San
                    Juan. It would open to them a door which by our answer of Monday we hoped we had
                    closed finally.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
